        "placeholder_text": "Coming soon",
        "who_image": "shopify://shop_images/who-we-are.png",
        "who_tag": "Our Story",
        "who_heading": "Enriching Life's Shared Joys",
        "who_paragraph_1": "Sulalat is a specialized ecosystem offering artisanal products, rooted in the careful selection of the finest harvests from the worlds of coffee, chocolate, and gelato. Since 2014, we've brought together globally sourced ingredients, certified expertise, and in-house production to serve the hospitality sector across the Middle East, with a partner network spanning more than 15 countries.",
        "who_paragraph_2": "While traveling in Europe, our founders saw how specialty coffee could bring people closer together. When they came home and couldn't find that same care anywhere nearby, they decided to build it themselves. Wayel Al-Wohaibi built the systems. Sara Al-Mutawa built the trust. Together, they've grown Sulalat from small-scale roasting into a specialty house shaped by experimentation, technical rigor, and patience.",
        "timeline_heading": "13+ Years of Serving with Sincerity & Heart ",
        "timeline_subheading": "Here are some highlights from moments that mark our growth.",
        "vision_heading": "Our Vision",
        "vision_text": "To become a trusted name for quality, consistency, and taste across the world.",
        "vision_image": "shopify://shop_images/vision-card-1.png",
        "mission_image": "shopify://shop_images/vision-card-2.png",
        "mission_heading": "Our Mission",
        "mission_text": "To source, produce, and deliver specialty food and beverage products with care and operational integrity.",
        "culture_heading": "The Foundation of Our Beliefs",
        "culture_paragraph_1": "We started as a team of just two. Now, we have evolved into a complete family, united in our purpose to set the highest standards and strive for the best.",
        "culture_paragraph_2": "We believe lasting growth comes from the values we practice every day, in our relationships, our work, and the standards we set for ourselves.",
        "culture_image": "shopify://shop_images/culture.png",
        "certificates_heading": "Our Certifications",
        "certificates_subheading": "<p>Our facilities, processes, and operations are supported by international certifications. Explore our commitment to consistency, safety, and responsible production.</p>",
        "executive_heading": "The Leaders Behind Our Vision /A Shared Purpose ",
        "executive_subheading": "Guided by their belief in excellence as an act of service, our executive team leads with humility, purpose, and an unwavering dedication to sharing quality of life.",
        "people_heading": "The People Behind Every Sulalat Experience ",
        "people_subheading": "Sulalat is home to a team of certified Q-graders, international judges, roasters, chocolatiers, gelato specialists, educators, and operational professionals.",
        "partners_heading": "Available Near You",
        "partners_subheading": "Find our products across the Kingdom's leading retailers and platforms.",
        "partners_supplier_heading": "Backed by Trusted Equipment Makers",
        "partners_supplier_subheading": "We work with leading global equipment makers to bring precision and consistency to every step of the process.",
        "partners_distributor_label": "Distributor",
        "partners_supplier_label": "Supplier",
